    <unit id="PageDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Pagination divides large data sets into predictable pages. It supports alignment, page size selection, quick jump input, total information, mini size, and simple read-only or editable modes.</source>
        <target state="translated">Pagination 将大型数据集拆分为可预测的页面，支持对齐方式、页大小选择、快速跳转、总数信息、迷你尺寸以及简洁只读或可编辑模式。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="PageSubtitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Navigate long lists with page numbers, sizes, totals, and quick jumps.</source>
        <target state="translated">用页码、页大小、总数和快速跳转浏览长列表。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="ScenarioExamples">
      <segment>
        <source>Examples</source>
        <target state="translated">示例</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticInfoDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Info element, set font, color and alignment styles for the page info text</source>
        <target state="translated">信息元素，设置页码信息文本的字体、颜色和对齐样式</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticItemDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Item element, set size, padding, border, background color, hover state and active state styles</source>
        <target state="translated">页码元素，设置尺寸、内边距、边框、背景色、悬停态和激活态样式</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticPartStyleDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Style the root and items through generated Semantic Part styles: a dashed outline around the root, rounded item corners, and item backgrounds that apply only at small size.</source>
        <target state="translated">通过生成的 Semantic Part 样式定制 root 与 item：root 使用虚线描边、item 使用圆角，item 背景仅在小尺寸下生效。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
